# Five-wire linear surface trap for 40Ca+ with seven DC segments (50 µm wide) on each side of the RF rails, whose RF null
# is 55 µm above the surface, with integrated photonics: grating couplers delivering 729 nm (qubit) and 854 nm (quench)
# light to the gate zone at the trap center, and 397 nm (detection) and 866 nm (repump) light to the measurement zone
# at x = 100 µm, above a 50 µm detector. Generated by Trap.from_preset(7, 50.0, photonics=True).
# Lengths are in µm, the RF frequency in rad/s, optical powers in W and dark count rates in 1/s.

